        "pendulum_lab ↔ pendulum_obs: -0.323 (chance ±0.374)",
        "resonator_lab ↔ resonator_obs: 0.348 (chance ±0.529)",
        "pendulum_lab autocorr: -0.262 (chance ±0.296)",
        "resonator_lab autocorr: -0.304 (chance ±0.419)",
        "resonator_obs autocorr: -0.431 (chance ±0.837)"
      ],
      "evidenceAgainst": [
        "pendulum_obs ↔ resonator_obs: 0.353 at 1-day offset (above chance ±0.395, weak but detectable)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Calibration baseline was established under anomalous conditions (e.g., thermal transient, systematic offset in one or more instruments); true physical repeatability is masked",
